sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as App
    participant P as Primary
    participant R as Replica
    A->>P: INSERT, COMMIT
    A->>P: pg_current_wal_lsn()
    P-->>A: 0/9A3F2C8
    Note over A: token saved<br/>in the session
    A->>R: pg_last_wal_replay_lsn()
    R-->>A: 0/9A1B000, behind
    A->>P: SELECT order
    P-->>A: order found
    Note over R: once replay passes<br/>the token, reads<br/>go back here
